	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<note>[Anfang scheint zu fehlen.]</note>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Si placet domino, nempe ut differam diutius, quam putavissem.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Sed nihil queror; nam scio me nunc navare <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non contemnendam operam in vulnerando anti<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>christo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Bone deus, qualem segetem et occasio<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nem inveni!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Scies omnia, quum rediero; <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non piget laboris neque tam longae morae, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nihil minus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vix spero fore, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ut citra duas septimanas queam hinc avelli; certe non avellar nis<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>i in calce huius mensis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Communica has d. <persName>Iosiae</persName> meo, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cui dicas velim nuncium ob quasdam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>causas mitti non potuisse; sed tuo atque <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>eius arbitrio com[m]itto, si videtur istinc <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ad me unum esse mittendum, id est, dispicite, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>num multum sit literarum mihi inscriptarum; <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quod si est, mittite, et ego solvam; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>at si una atque altera esset epistola, non <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>esset, quod mitteretis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vestro, inquam, iu<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dicio omnia, quamquam etiam de <persName>Iosiae</persName> legatione <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>optarem certior fieri, quid constituissetis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Absum ab aula; itaque nihil certi habeo novarum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>rerum, quod scribam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Mira dicuntur: <persName ref="p18250">Mauritium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cum <persName>Alberto</persName> covenisse et parare <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>utrumque magnum exercitum; nescitur con<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tra quem, quin addunt illis adiunctum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>esse <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName>, aiunt, ut resistatur <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>principi <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniarum</placeName>, Ces[aris] filio, in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ingressuro.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De Ces[are] ipso, qui expuaverit <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>urbem, quam obsidebat, istic melius potuisti <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>intelligere.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Comitia ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> <placeName ref="l513">Ulmam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sunt translata, sed vix celebrabuntur ob <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>tam magnos bellorum motus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Audio <persName ref="p2095">Mel<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>anthonem</persName> vivere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Iterum de literis et nuntio <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ad me mittendo dico, si multae sint, sane <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>mittite, si paucę, abstinete.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Non quero am<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>plius mitti librum ex sarcina mea, quem <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName>Iosiae</persName> dixeram; illum tantum oro, ut spargat <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>eos libros, quemadmodum dixi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scribo d. <lb xml:id="p2z13"/><persName>Ascanio Marso</persName>, ut curet quęrendum in castri<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>s Cesareis, quae in <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontio</placeName> sint, num <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>illic Ludovicus, meus nepos esset; ideo rogo, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>ut cures illi literas.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Has dimiserat apud <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>me <persName>Iosias</persName> et nollem fuisse ob <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>nepotem, cuius adhuc cogor curam habere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Vale et salve cum tota familia, schola atque <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>ecclesia.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te <persName ref="p8113">Volmarius</persName>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l512">Tubin<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>gae</placeName> 10. iulii 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Si videbitur nuncium ad me esse mittendum, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>consultum putarem, ut statim mitteretis <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>et non differetis ob multas causas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z5"/>Omnino monete d. <persName ref="p4063">Io[annem] Zieglerum</persName>, ut <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>extrahat vestas duas ex sarcinis <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>meis, ne corrumpantur, sed alibi <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>in suis cistis servet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Tibi <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>i.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
